cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research or a product, please cite it as below."
title: "hk-spatial-mcp: an MCP server for Hong Kong CSDI spatial data"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency Model Context Protocol server that exposes Hong Kong's Common
  Spatial Data Infrastructure catalogue (1,154 official datasets) to any AI agent:
  multilingual dataset search, GeoJSON retrieval, numeric answers, and 2D/3D map
  output, with no API key or GIS installation required.
authors:
